Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.38,0:00:02.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Raj...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.38,0:00:02.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:05.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...hand me the number six Torx screwdriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:05.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我六号六角螺丝刀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}住手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.09,0:00:10.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't do this. It's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.09,0:00:10.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能这么做 这是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, you have got two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你有两个选择
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:16.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Put a bigger hard drive in the TiVo or delete stuff before we go out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:16.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在录影机里装容量更大的硬盘 或是在离开前删掉一些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But once you open the box, you've voided the warranty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可一旦开箱 保修单就作废了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:24.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The warranty is a sacred covenant we've entered into with the manufacturer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:24.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保修单是我们跟制造商的神圣契约
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:26.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He offers to stand by his equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:26.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他愿意为他的设备担保
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:29.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We in return agree not to violate the integrity of the internal hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:29.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们则同意不开箱 亵渎内部硬件
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:34.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This little orange sticker is all that stands between us and anarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:34.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这张橘色的小贴纸 阻止我们迈向混乱的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, then we won't touch the hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我们不碰硬盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll just erase the first season of Battlestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要删除第一季的《太空堡垒》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There. We're outlaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 现在我们是罪犯了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:50.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Here you go, Leonard. Is this big enough? -It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:50.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-给你 莱纳德 这够大吗？ -非常完美
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.39,0:00:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For taking daffodils to your unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.39,0:00:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以装水仙花送给独角兽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:00:59.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just for my notebooks. Thanks, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:00:59.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是要装笔记本 谢谢你 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:01.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love San Francisco. I wish I was going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:01.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱旧金山 真希望我能跟你们一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:03.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand your envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:03.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解你的羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:05.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a can't-miss symposium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:05.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是不能错过的座谈会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are going to be discussions on bioorganic cellular computer devices...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要讨论生物有机细胞电脑设备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:11.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...advancements in multi-threaded task completion...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:11.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进阶多重任务工作室
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.99,0:01:15.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...plus a round table on the non-equilibrium Green's Function approach...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.99,0:01:15.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有用非平衡格林函数解决
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:18.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to the photoionization process in atoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原子内光化电离过程的圆桌会议呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I go, I usually just get hammered and ride the cable cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去那里就是为了喝酒跟搭电车
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:24.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This conference is a big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:24.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这次会议是件大事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The keynote address is delivered by George Smoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主讲人是乔治斯穆特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. The George Smoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 乔治斯穆特？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You've heard of him? -Of course I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你听说过他？ -当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George Smoot is a Nobel Prize-winning physicist...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治斯穆特是诺贝尔物理奖得主
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...one of the great minds of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当代的伟大天才
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.81,0:01:40.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His work in black body form...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.81,0:01:40.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的黑体研究
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and anisotropy of the cosmic microwave background radiation...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟宇宙微波背景辐射各向异性度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:47.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...cemented our understanding of the origin of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:47.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮助我们了解宇宙起源
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:48.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's kind of a funny name though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:48.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他的名字很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:51.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:51.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}斯穆特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:55.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like talking to a chimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:55.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就像是在跟猩猩说话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:02:00.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, now that I've been completely insulted, have a good flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:02:00.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 现在我被侮辱过了 祝你们飞行愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:03.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, I wish. -We're not flying. We're taking the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:03.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我也希望 -我们不坐飞机 要坐火车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:04.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:04.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:09.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, cool. Seven times as long as flying and costs almost twice as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:09.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 太酷了 时间是坐飞机的七倍 费用将近是两倍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:13.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well then why are you doing it? -Well, we had a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:13.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那为什么你们还要那么做？ -我们投票决定的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three voted for airplane, Sheldon voted for train.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三个人要坐飞机 谢尔顿要坐火车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So we're taking the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们要坐火车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:23.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't say it like that, Leonard. Say it like, "We're taking the train!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:23.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别那么说 莱纳德 你应该说“我们要坐火车呢！”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:49.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:52.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're going to the Apple store to make fun of the Genius Bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:52.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要到苹果电脑专卖店 捉弄技术人员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:54.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wanna come?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:54.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I always enjoy that, but I'm a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一向都喜欢那么做 但我有点忙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在忙什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:01.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm simplifying the task of packing for our trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:01.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在简化我们的打包工作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, by attaching RFID tags to my clothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将电子标签贴在我的衣服上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:07.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it will enable my laptop to read and identify the items with this wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:07.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这根魔杖就能让我的手提电脑 扫描辨认所有东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:11.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then cross-reference them against destination, anticipated activity spectrum...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:11.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我再跟目的地做交叉比对 预测活动范围
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...weather conditions, duration of trip, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天气状况跟旅行时间等等
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that does sound much simpler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来是简单多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:23.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How long is this gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:23.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这得花多少时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Assuming I can keep up this pace, three hours 11 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以现在的速度计算 应该是三小时十一分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:30.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus however long it takes to conclude this fairly pointless conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:30.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还得考虑我还得忍受 这些无意义谈话的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.09,0:03:32.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Teasing the guys at the Apple store seems a little redundant now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在想一想到苹果电脑专卖店 捉弄那些人似乎很无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:39.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't follow. -I wouldn't expect you to. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:39.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不明白 -我不期待你会懂 待会见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:42.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCANNER BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Socks, one pair, cotton, argyle, blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}袜子 一双 棉质 菱形花纹 蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCANNER BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Socks, one pair, cotton, argyle, blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}袜子 一双 棉质 菱形花纹 蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What on earth are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们到底在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whatever it is, I'm guessing we're doing it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不论是在做什么 我想我们都做错了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:10.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, this is the Coast Starlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先生们 这是海岸星光号
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...one of the great American trains operating on one of the classic American routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}国内最好的火车行经美国的经典路线
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On this side, you'll see panoramic ocean vistas...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在这边可以看到广角海岸美景
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...inaccessible to any other form of transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:21.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是搭其它交通工具看不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:25.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While on your side you'll be treated to 350 miles...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:25.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在这边你们则会看到563公里的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:29.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of Costcos, Jiffy Lubes and cinder block homes with above-ground pools.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:29.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超市 修车厂 带凸地泳池的煤渣砖房子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:33.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Come on, Raj. -What's wrong with Jiffy Lubes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:33.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-来吧 拉吉 -修车厂有什么不好的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:37.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:37.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:40.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why not? -That's over the wheelbase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:40.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -这个位置在车轮上方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:43.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you completely unfamiliar with the suspension characteristics...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:43.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不了解1980年以前 普尔曼制造的超级豪华客车车厢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:47.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of a pre-1980 Pullman-built Superliner Deluxe passenger coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:47.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}悬吊系统的特质吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, we've been on this train 90 seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们上车才90秒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:52.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you've already said a thousand words.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:52.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你已经说了1000个字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:55.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just tell us where to sit and shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:55.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我们该坐在哪里 闭上嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm hoping once you reap the endorphic rewards...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望你们一旦了解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:04.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of the steady clickety-clack of steel wheels on polished rails...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:04.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钢制车轮在铁轨上稳定行进的好处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:08.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...your sour disposition will abate. -Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:08.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们就不会生气了 -对 或许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:13.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Back in the 21st century, people are raising tray tables and putting seat-backs upright...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:13.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同时在21世纪人们会收起餐盘 将椅背竖直
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:16.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because it's time to land in San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:16.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们快要在旧金山降落了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.19,0:05:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not so bad really. At least these trains have modern plumbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.19,0:05:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也没那么糟糕 至少这些火车有现代化洗手间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In India, you squat over a hole in the train and expose your naked buttocks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在印度你只能对着小孔 露出光溜溜的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to the chilly air of Rajasthan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}享受拉贾斯坦的冷风
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.83,0:05:28.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He is referring, of course, to third class...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.83,0:05:28.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然他是指印度铁路局的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:31.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on Indian Railways' magnificent Ranakpur Express...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:31.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}热那克普特快车三等客舱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:36.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and its 1200-kilometer journey from Maharashtra to the Bikaner Junction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:36.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}1200公里旅程 从马哈拉施特拉到比卡内尔站
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look. Now he's boring on an international scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快看 他连无聊到有国际水准了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Holy crap, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊 快看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is that who I think it is? -It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没有看错吧？ -不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:50.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What would Summer Glau be doing riding the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:50.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}萨摩格拉为什么会坐火车？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:54.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe John Connor's aboard and she's protecting him from an evil Terminator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:54.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许约翰康纳在车上 她要保护他不受坏终结者伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unlikely. That's a television show, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可能性很低 那是电视剧情 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:05:59.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:05:59.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.03,0:06:04.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If Skynet did exist in the future, a perfect way to infiltrate and destroy mankind...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.03,0:06:04.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然如果未来真的有天网 这是渗透摧毁人类的好方法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would be to send Terminators back as actors...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}派终结者化装成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who have played Terminators in films and television...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}演过《终结者》电影跟电视演员的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:12.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...lulling us into a false sense of security, i.e.:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:12.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我们误以为自己很安全 譬如说…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:15.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"That's Summer Glau from The Sarah Connor Chronicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:15.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“她是《终结者外传》里的萨摩格拉”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Summer, don't kill me! I'm pro-robot."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“不 萨摩 不要杀我 我也是机器人”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GROANING]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least he's off the train crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少他不谈火车的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:25.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[TRAIN STARTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:27.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Wheeee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我得跟你道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:34.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Taking the train was a stroke of brilliance. I've actually got a shot at a Terminator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:34.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐火车是聪明之举 我有机会可以泡到终结者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:36.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please. When it comes to Terminators...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 提到终结者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:39.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you've got a better shot of scoring with Arnold Schwarzenegger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:39.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你泡到阿诺施瓦辛格的机率还比较高
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:42.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're overlooking something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:42.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忘了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:47.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have 11 hours with her in a confined space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:47.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要跟她在密闭车厢相处11小时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless she's willing to jump off a moving train...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非她想跳车
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...tuck and roll down the side of a hill, she will eventually succumb...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}滚到山丘下 最后她会屈服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:58.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to the acquired taste that is Howard Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:58.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜倒在霍华德沃洛维茨的魅力下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:03.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My money's on tuck and roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:03.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我赌她会跳车滚下山丘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:05.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:05.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我都被搞糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:10.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought you were involved in some sort of socially intimate pairing with Leslie Winkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:10.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你正在和莱斯丽温克尔 进行社会亲密动态连结
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:14.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Let me explain to you how this works. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:14.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我得跟你解释一下 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:16.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's Summer Glau. -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:16.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她是萨摩格拉 -所以呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:18.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:18.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why do you get first crack at her? -Uh, well, let's see. Couple reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么你能先泡她？ -让我想想 原因很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One, I saw her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一 我先看到她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:27.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you didn't. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:27.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 才怪 是我先
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fair enough. But then let me move on to number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 但是让我提出第二个理由
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:34.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unlike you, I can actually talk to women when I'm sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:34.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你不同 不必喝醉就能跟女人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You fail to take into account that even mute, I am foreign and exotic...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忘记即使我不说话 都满含有异国情调
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...while you, on the other hand, are frail and pasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是你懦弱又不健康
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:46.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you know the old saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:46.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}俗话说的好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pasty and frail, never fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}懦弱又不健康的男人永远不会失败
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:54.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, but what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:54.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 那我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:55.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't I get a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:55.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么我没有机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:59.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine, go ahead, take a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:59.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啊 你去试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:03.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've already got a gorgeous blonde back home I can't score with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:03.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}家里有个漂亮金发美女 但我一直泡不到她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:05.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I'll let you two take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:05.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是你们两个去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:08.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, is there a place on this train to get alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:08.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 这辆列车有卖酒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:09.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Interesting that you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:09.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会那么问真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:13.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Coast Starlight recently added the refurbished Pacific Parlour Car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:13.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}海岸星光号最近加了 刚装修过的太平洋餐车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Built in 1956 and originally known as the Santa Fe Lounge Car, the lower level--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}建于1956年 原先称为圣塔非餐车 低层…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Which way? -Upper level is a bar...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-哪边？ -上层是酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that offers wine tastings if you're going as far as Portland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你要去波特兰 他们还提供品酒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:25.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aren't you gonna go talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:25.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不去跟她说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:28.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will. I'm just working on my opening line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:28.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会的 我在练习开场白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's probably heard every possible line, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许她什么开场白都听过 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:32.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you try, "Hello?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:32.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你何不直接跟她打招呼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. That always creeps girls out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那会把女生吓跑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:40.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need to come up with something that's funny, smart and delicately suggests...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:40.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得想出聪明幽默的说法 微妙地暗示她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:43.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that my sexual endowment is disproportionate to my physical stature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:43.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的性能力跟外表成正比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:47.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna need more than 11 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:47.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}11个小时还不够你用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:49.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:49.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:52.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the matter? -I forgot my flash drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:52.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -我忘了带优盘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:54.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -So we have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:54.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -我们得回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Sheldon, I'm gonna say, "Why?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢尔顿 我得说“为什么？”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:09:01.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And your answer cannot be "Because I forgot my flash drive."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:09:01.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的回答不能是 “因为我忘了带优盘”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不了解
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:05.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My flash drive has my paper on astrophysical probes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:05.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的优盘里存了我的论文
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of M-theory effects in the early universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}探索初期宇宙Ｍ理论对 太空探测计划的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I was gonna give to George Smoot at the conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望在会议上拿给乔治斯穆特看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:13.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you have to give your paper to George Smoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:13.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么你要把论文给乔治斯穆特看？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's brilliant. He needs to read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我写得太好了 他得看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you'll send him an email when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们回家后你可以用电子邮件发给他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:22.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I won't get to see his face light up as he reads it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:22.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那样子我就看不到 他看到论文时的惊喜表情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Right. Of course. -Oh, this is an unmitigated disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 当然 -这是意想不到的灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:28.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there's nothing you can do about it, so relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:28.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一点办法都没有 放轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sit back, enjoy the clickety-clack of the steel wheels on the polished rails.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐好 享受钢制车轮 在铁轨上发出的咔哒咔哒声
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:40.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING] You forgot your flash drive You forgot your flash drive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:40.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忘了带优盘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You forgot your flash drive You forgot your flash drive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忘了带优盘…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You forgot your flash drive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忘了带优盘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Only 10 hours, 55 minutes to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只剩10小时55分了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:51.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You forgot your flash drive You forgot your flash drive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:51.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忘了带优盘…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:10:00.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's hot in here. Must be Summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:10:00.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里好热 一定是夏天的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, where you gals headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I've found the perfect solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我想出了完美的解决办法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We get off the train at the next stop in Oxnard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在下一站奥克斯纳下车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:24.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We then take the 1:13 train back to Union Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:24.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搭1点13分的火车回联合车站
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We take a cab back, get my flash drive...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:26.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搭计程车回家拿我的优盘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and race to San Luis Obispo, assuming the lights are with us, minimal traffic...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冲到圣路易奥比斯波 假设一路绿灯没碰上塞车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we'll meet the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就可以跟这列火车会合
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:35.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I've got a better idea. -Are you going to be sarcastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:35.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我有更好的点子 -你会讽刺我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:39.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, you take all the fun out of it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:39.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 你剥夺了我的乐趣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:40.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, look, Penny's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:40.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 佩妮在家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't we call her, have her get your flash drive and e-mail you the paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们为什么不打电话让她拿优盘 将论文用电子邮件寄给你？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:47.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But the flash drive is in a locked drawer in my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:47.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但优盘放在我桌子上锁的抽屉里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -The key is hidden in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -钥匙藏在我的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -Penny'd have to go into my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -佩妮得进我的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:54.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -People don't go in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:54.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -我不让别人进我房间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:56.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see. Well, it seems once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:56.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂了 看来这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:11:00.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you're caught between a rock and a crazy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:11:00.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的是退无可退了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I hate when that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我讨厌发生这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's hot in here. Must be Summer. It's hot in here. Must be summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里好热 一定是夏天的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:11.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's hot in here. Must be Summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:11.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里好热 一定是夏天的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:14.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's hot in here. Must be Summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:14.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里好热 一定是夏天的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's cute. -Really? I just made it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你这话很有趣 -真的吗？我刚刚想到的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:22.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you seen Slumdog Millionaire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:22.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看过《贫民窟的百万富翁》吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:24.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh yeah, I loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:24.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 我很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:26.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's loosely based on my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:26.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它差不多就是我的人生写照
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:33.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're putting the play on for one night in this little 99-seat theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:33.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要在99人小剧院演出一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you come? Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能来吗？太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:38.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know 98 other people that might wanna come?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:38.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还知道哪98个人可能会想来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hang on. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen. I'm about to give you a set of instructions...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我要给你一连串的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:45.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which you must follow to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:45.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最好乖乖照做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.46,0:11:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Theater's above a bowling alley so it's a little noisy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.46,0:11:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}剧院在保龄球馆楼上 可能会有点吵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:54.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but it might be the only chance I'll ever get to play Anne Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:54.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这可能是我出演 安妮法兰克的唯一机会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the director is brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}导演是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:11:59.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He uses the bowling sounds as, like, Nazi artillery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:11:59.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他利用保龄球馆的噪音 装做是纳粹在进行机枪扫射
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:02.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, great, I'll see you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:02.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了 到时候见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:05.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello? SHELDON: Okay, step four.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:05.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-喂 -好吧 第四步
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:08.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you see that small plastic case on my dresser?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:08.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看到我柜子里的小塑料盒了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.27,0:12:10.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your dresser? Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.27,0:12:10.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的柜子？你到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:12.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:15.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我是谢尔顿 -谢尔顿 旧金山还好玩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.73,0:12:15.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Oh, hey, Sheldon. How's San Francisco?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:19.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not in San Francisco. I'm on a tra-- Were you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:19.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不在旧金山 我在火… -你有在听我说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:23.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, I was talking to my friend. What's up? -What's up? I'll tell you what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:23.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 我在跟朋友说话 怎么了？ -怎么了？我来告诉你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:24.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm in a crisis situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:24.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我身处危险
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:28.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I need you to marshal your powers of concentration, limited as they may be--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:28.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你专心一点 虽然你的注意力有限…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:30.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:30.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把手机交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:33.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Penny, it's Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:33.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我是莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard, what's going on with Dr. Wackadoodle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 疯狂白痴博士是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's calling to ask you a favor. You might be confused...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他打电话请你帮忙 或许你被弄糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because he didn't use the words "Penny," "Sheldon," "please" or "favor."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他没有说“佩妮” “谢尔顿”“请”或“帮忙”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Enough chitchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 别再聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:50.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, step one: Locate your emergency key to our apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:50.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一步 找出我们家的备用钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:55.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Step two: Enter our apartment. Step three....
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:55.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第二步 进入我们家 第三步
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:57.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Enter my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:57.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进入我的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:00.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Step four-- -Yeah, hang on, getting another call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:00.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-第四步 -等一下 有人打给我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:02.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:02.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:05.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me tell you something. Personal robots cannot get here soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:05.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我得告诉你一件事 机器人管家真是研发得太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:13.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that bright little star peeking her head out early today...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:13.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天一早就出现在天空的小星星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:15.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that's Venus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:15.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是金星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:19.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know a lot about space.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:19.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你非常了解太空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:25.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. When you were on TV in Firefly, you were actually in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:25.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来了 在《萤火虫》电视剧里 你真的上过太空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:28.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not one of those guys who believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:28.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不会跟那些人一样 也相信那是真的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:32.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean one of the hopeless geeks? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:32.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说那些无药可救的呆瓜吗？ 当然不了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:33.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Those are crazy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:33.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们都是疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:36.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BOTH CHUCKLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, be a dear and get me another one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 拜托你再帮我买瓶啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:47.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now him, he's one of those geeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:47.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他就是那种呆瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, now before you enter my bedroom unescorted...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 在你单独进入我的房间前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:55.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I need you to understand that this one time grant of access...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:55.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你了解这是一次性事件
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...does not create a permanent easement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不代表你永远有这种权利
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Easement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}权利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:05.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a legal right of access. Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:05.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是法律术语 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? No, don't put me on hold. I-- Oh....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？别让我等 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:13.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Do you believe him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:13.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们能相信他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:18.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Normally around women, he has the personality of a boiled potato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:18.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通常一有女人在 他就闷不吭声
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:21.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Put one beer in him, and he's M. Knight Charmalarmalon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:21.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喝了啤酒 他倒成了花花公子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:27.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that what he's drinking? It's not even real beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:27.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他就是喝这个吗？这不是真的啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -你自己看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Non-alcoholic beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无酒精啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Then what's going on? -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是怎么一回事？ -我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:38.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some sort of placebo effect, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:38.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想是某种安慰剂效应
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Placebo, you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安慰剂效应 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:45.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I'm still here. Where am I going? I'm on a train.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:45.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还在 我能去哪里？我在火车上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, what you'll be looking for is a small wooden box...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要找一个小木盒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:55.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...located between a Hoberman Sphere and a sample of quartz flecked with pyrite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:55.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放在霍伯曼球面 和嵌着黄矿铜的石英样本旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:56.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hoberman Sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:56.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍伯曼球面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:15:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a collapsible icosidodecahedron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:15:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它是可伸缩的截半二十面体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:05.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, the thing with the time on it is my alarm clock. My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:05.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 会显示时间的东西是闹钟 我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:10.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, in India, the names of constellations are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:10.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上在印度 星座的名字不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:15.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where you have the Big Dipper, we have the Big Curry Pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:15.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们口中的大熊星座 我们称它为大咖哩锅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:17.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're making that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:17.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是你编出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被你发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, what are you going to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:22.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要怎么处罚我？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Raj. Look. -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拉吉 看啊 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:30.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What am I looking at? -You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:30.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要我看什么？ -你来告诉我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:33.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Non-alcoholic beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:33.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无酒精啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. I'm the small package good things come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 我是个好男人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:51.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I got a box, but there's no key in here. Just letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:51.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我找到一个盒子 但没看到钥匙 只有信
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:53.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the wrong box. Put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:53.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你找错盒子了 把它放回去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Sheldon, are these letters from your grandmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:56.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 这是你奶奶写给你的信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:58.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't read those letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:58.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别看那些信
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:01.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look, she calls you Moon Pie. That is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:01.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看啊 她叫你小月饼 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.63,0:16:03.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHRIEKING] Put down the letters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.63,0:16:03.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把信放好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Penny. It's Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我是莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:10.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard. How's the train ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:10.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 坐火车还好玩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Delightful. I don't know what you're doing right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很不错 我不知道你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but there are little bubbles forming in the corner of Sheldon's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但谢尔顿的嘴角在冒泡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:20.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Yeah, I kind of crossed a line. Put him back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:20.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我有点太过分了 让他接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:21.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:21.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:25.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm back. -What up, Moon Pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:25.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我回来了 -怎么了？小月饼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:29.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one calls me Moon Pie but Meemaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:29.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有婆婆能叫我小月饼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:33.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Penny. Leonard again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:33.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 又是莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:38.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So anyway, in the dream, you and I were ice skating, just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:38.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之在梦里 你跟我在溜冰 只有我们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then I picked you up by your ankles...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我抓住你的脚踝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and twirled you round and round until your legs tore off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不停旋转 直到我把你的腿拽掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I tried to stick them back on, but before I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我试着把它们接回去 但在我那么做前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.51,0:16:56.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you turned into a giant loaf of pumpernickel bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.51,0:16:56.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你变成了一条巨大的黑麦面包
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:57.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you think that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:57.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得那代表什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:04.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll give you a little clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:04.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给你一点提示
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:07.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My favorite sandwich? Salami on pumpernickel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:07.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最爱的三明治？ 黑麦面包夹萨拉米香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.61,0:17:09.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.61,0:17:09.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:14.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you know the word pumpernickel comes from the German words pumper and knickel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:14.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道黑麦面包一字源自 德文的“庞普”跟“尼克尔”吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which loosely translates to fart goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大概可以翻译成放屁的小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:21.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:21.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:26.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I found the box. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:26.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我找到一个盒子 然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:32.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're holding a Japanese puzzle box, which takes 10 precise moves to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:32.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你拿着日本人使用的迷箱 得用10个步骤才能打开它
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, first locate the panel with the diamond pattern...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 先找出有菱形图案的面板
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.89,0:17:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and slide the center portion 1 millimeter to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.89,0:17:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将中心往左移一毫米
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:41.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then, on the opposite end of the box...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:41.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在盒子的对侧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:45.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...slide the entire panel down 2 millimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:45.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将整块面板往下移两毫米
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:47.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll hear a slight click.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:47.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会听见“喀”的一声
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:51.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on. Sheldon, do you have any emotional attachment to this box?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:51.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 谢尔顿 这个盒子对你有特殊意义吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:54.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. It's a novelty I ordered off the Internet. Did you hear the click?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:54.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那是我在网上买来的 你有听到“喀”的一声吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我又想到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:10.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you married the famous rock guitarist Johnny Winter...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:10.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你嫁给 著名摇滚吉他手约翰尼温特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:13.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'd be Summer Winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:13.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得改姓叫萨摩温特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:16.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh-huh. -Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:16.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:22.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm gonna just go for broke here and say I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:22.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我要休息一下 跟你说我喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:23.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:23.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:25.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So here's my question:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:25.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:30.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you see any conversational path that would take us from where we are now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:30.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得这样的谈话能让我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:33.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to a place where I could ask you out and you'd say yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:33.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进展到我开口约你 你会一口答应的地步吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:40.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fair enough. I'll leave you in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:40.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我就不烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But before I go...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我离开前
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:52.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would you mind if I just take one picture of us together for my Facebook page?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:52.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们能合张影 让我发布在脸书上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:07.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I take one where it looks like we're making out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:07.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能拍张我们看起来 像是在亲热的照片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, now you're going to insert the flash drive into the USB port.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你得将优盘插入USB接头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.61,0:19:16.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[EXHALES SHARPLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:21.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She calls me Moon Pie because I'm nummy-nummy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:21.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她叫我小月饼 因为我超可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and she could just eat me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她想一口吃掉我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now please put the flash drive in the USB port.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快把优盘插到USB接头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:34.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The one that looks like a little duck's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:34.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}长得像鸭嘴的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, how'd it go? -Terminator broke my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-结果如何？ -终结者砸烂了我的手机
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'll be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我要坦白跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:53.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've spent the last two hours imagining various scenarios in my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:53.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚花了两个小时的时间 想象各种不同的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:56.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...trying to come up with some line to say to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:56.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}试着想些聪明的话来跟搭讪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:20:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but then I finally realized you're a human being, I'm a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:20:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后来我意识到你是人类 我是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:01.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could just say--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:02.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我只需说… -下一站圣芭芭拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:02.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CONDUCTOR [ON PA]: Next stop, Santa Barbara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:04.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. This is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:04.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 我到站了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.91,0:20:09.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Hi, my name's Leonard."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.91,0:20:09.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 我是莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:16.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I'm thinking you won the Nobel Prize, what, three years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:16.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就想 你是在三年前拿的诺贝尔奖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.01,0:20:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so you must deal with a whole lot of "What has Smoot done lately?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.01,0:20:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定有很多人问你 “斯穆特最近在做什么？”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:24.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My thought is we continue my research as a team, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:24.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为我们可以一起继续我的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:26.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Cooper-Smoot, alphabetical...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:26.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就说它是库珀-斯穆特计划 以字母顺序来排列
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and when we win the Nobel Prize, you'll be back on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们拿到诺贝尔奖后 你就能重返巅峰了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:33.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With all due respect, Dr. Cooper, are you on crack?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:33.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恕我冒昧 库珀博士 你嗑药了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:40.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. Smoot-Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:40.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 斯穆特-库珀计划
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:42.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, what a diva.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:42.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真自恋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.22,0:21:10.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 郑伟
